From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: use distribution Python Protobuf bindings

The upstream build pin requires Protobuf 6.31.1, while openRuyi provides
7.35.1. Use the same minimum version as the runtime dependency so the
build can use the distribution code generator bindings.

Reference: https://github.com/onnx/onnx/blob/v1.23.2/pyproject.toml
Status: Not submitted upstream.
Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 
 [build-system]
-requires = ["scikit-build-core>=0.11", "protobuf==6.31.1"]
+requires = ["scikit-build-core>=0.11", "protobuf>=6.31.1"]
 build-backend = "scikit_build_core.build"
 
 [project]
